00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.535
- She was like very theatrical before.

00:00:19.535 --> 00:00:22.007
And now she's just kinda like glamorous.

00:00:22.007 --> 00:00:24.001
I'm willing to try for Gaga.

00:00:24.001 --> 00:00:25.531
(playful electronic music)

00:00:25.531 --> 00:00:26.780
- [Kelsey] This is kind
of what I expected.

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:28.714
- [Evan] I expected like, mermaid frappe.

00:00:28.714 --> 00:00:30.126
- No, that's old Lady Gaga.

00:00:30.126 --> 00:00:31.428
- Not today's Lady Gaga?

00:00:31.428 --> 00:00:32.946
- Today's Lady Gaga's more refined

00:00:32.946 --> 00:00:34.868
and serious, like you said.
- Okay.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:35.701
- Mmm!

00:00:36.576 --> 00:00:38.089
- Oh, it's good!

00:00:38.089 --> 00:00:39.622
- It's got lime, coconut milk.

00:00:39.622 --> 00:00:40.554
- That's what it is.

00:00:40.554 --> 00:00:43.579
It's like a pink tea, watered
down and a little milky

00:00:43.579 --> 00:00:44.632
with a hint of lime.

00:00:44.632 --> 00:00:46.226
- I like this.

00:00:46.226 --> 00:00:47.262
I can drink this everyday.

00:00:47.262 --> 00:00:49.058
This is good.

00:00:49.058 --> 00:00:53.225
- [Kelsey] What, what, what
is this? I'm about this.

00:00:55.159 --> 00:00:56.717
So if you're wanting a green tea,

00:00:56.717 --> 00:01:00.032
this would be disappointing
because it's definitely not.

00:01:00.032 --> 00:01:02.859
But the more I drink it
actually, the more I'm like,

00:01:02.859 --> 00:01:05.169
oh, it's like a nice tea with a lemon,

00:01:05.169 --> 00:01:07.647
and the tea happens to be Matcha tea.

00:01:07.647 --> 00:01:09.393
- It's more lemonade than Matcha.

00:01:09.393 --> 00:01:11.026
- I only taste Matcha.

00:01:11.026 --> 00:01:11.941
- [Kelsey] You're crazy.
(laughs)

00:01:11.941 --> 00:01:14.442
- I love Starbucks' Green Tea Frappuccino.

00:01:14.442 --> 00:01:16.348
- [Kelsey] That's mostly
not green tea as well.

00:01:16.348 --> 00:01:17.181
- Oh, really?

00:01:17.181 --> 00:01:18.779
- Kelsey, have you worked
at Starbucks before?

00:01:18.779 --> 00:01:20.997
- I don't order anything but
dark coffee at Starbucks.

00:01:20.997 --> 00:01:22.677
- [Evan] You're very like...
- Maybe it's just confidence.

00:01:22.677 --> 00:01:25.730
I'm just very opinionated. (laughs)

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:28.094
(heavy rock music)

00:01:28.094 --> 00:01:31.579
