00:01:34.291 --> 00:01:35.172
- [YB] Oh, it's flowers.

00:01:35.172 --> 00:01:37.233
- [Evan] Of course you know.
(laughs)

00:01:37.233 --> 00:01:40.227
- I have no idea what
this is gonna taste like.

00:01:40.227 --> 00:01:43.867
This is pretty sweet, but I
actually kinda don't hate it.

00:01:43.867 --> 00:01:45.691
I like that there's berries in it.

00:01:45.691 --> 00:01:46.633
That makes me happy.

00:01:46.633 --> 00:01:49.248
- I know you're into berries. Yeah.

00:01:49.248 --> 00:01:51.484
Hibis- (babbles).
- You got this.

00:01:51.484 --> 00:01:52.733
