flavors going on at once.

00:02:03.419 --> 00:02:04.569
- There is a lot of different flavors.

00:02:04.569 --> 00:02:06.526
- There's like a flower-y flavor,

00:02:06.526 --> 00:02:09.276
there's a little bit of
milk from the coconut milk.

00:02:09.276 --> 00:02:11.212
- I taste cinnamon.
- Hmm?

00:02:11.212 --> 00:02:13.372
- Am I crazy?
- I think you're crazy.

00:02:13.372 --> 00:02:14.676
- Maybe I am.
(laughs)

00:02:14.676 --> 00:02:17.125
