00:02:42.245 --> 00:02:43.430
(laughs)
- Yup!

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:44.263
- Cheers!

00:02:44.263 --> 00:02:45.096
Cheers cheers!

00:02:45.096 --> 00:02:46.654
